2. Free permitted use

Subject to the conditions below, the licensor grants a worldwide, non-exclusive,
royalty-free copyright license to use, reproduce, inspect, modify, create
derivative works of and distribute the Software for:

(a) personal, non-commercial use by an individual, including learning, hobby
